From 5b0a9acc4b07d537aea44da88f3d970602e9ab96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Santos <lsantos7654@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 13:55:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 21/29] Capture git branch and remote URL in session metadata
 at creation

Read .git/HEAD and .git/config (origin remote) via synchronous
filesystem I/O in createNext so every session carries its git
context. Handles worktrees (gitdir: pointer files) and falls
back silently on non-git directories / unexpected formats.
